00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.100
Guys, I'm excited about this.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.234
Kim Kardashian
is my guest tonight.

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:15.601
Kim is amazing.

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:18.934
She's a business mogul, a
fashion icon, a reality star.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:20.367
And if she wants to be,

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:22.567
the 47th President
of the United States.

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.501
That's what I'm talking about,
tonight.

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.801
If she wants.
If she wants.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.400
Of course I'm in
a good mood today.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.234
It's the first day of summer.

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:33.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.934
Seriously, I heard so many
white claws crack open today.

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:38.367
I thought the --
I thought the cicadas were back.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:41.467
You could tell it's summer.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:43.934
This morning, my Uber driver
drove around with the top down.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:45.567
And by the top,
I mean his shirt.

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:47.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.334
But yes, summer is here,
which means you've got about

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:52.067
