00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.734
"Wow, this really is the longest
day of the year."

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:21.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:26.467
But this is sweet.
At one point a five-year-old

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.400
